0001: """
0002: ARC unified helper library (single file, canonical APIs).
0003: 
0004: This module is the single shared helper surface that *all* solver examples should
0005: use (ARC-2 and migrated ARC-1 seeds), so they can appear together in one prompt
0006: without API confusion.
0007: 
0008: ## Conventions (non-negotiable)
0009: - Grid shape: `grid.shape == (H, W)` meaning `(rows, cols)`.
0010: - Indexing: always `grid[r, c]`.
0011: - Coords: always `(r, c)`.
0012: - BBox: `(r0, c0, r1, c1)` inclusive.
